OL,3,GNEWSA'We need people who want to help
OL,4,Atheir community'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey charity has appealed for
OL,7,Fvolunteers amid unprecedented demand
OL,8,Ffor its services.
OL,10,FCare for Guildford said it urgently
OL,11,Fneeded more people to help it provide
OL,12,Ftransport for around 500 residents to
OL,13,Fessential medical appointments.
OL,15,FThe charity said its volunteers
OL,16,Fprovided more than 3,700 lifts each
OL,17,Fyear for people who had no family
OL,18,Fnearby, could not manage public
OL,19,Ftransport and or afford taxis.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
